insert into transmission_units (code, family, reliability_note) values ('generic:2-speed rear + single-speed front', 'single_speed', 'Generic bucket — specific unit not identifiable. Series-hybrid / fixed-ratio drive: the wheels are driven by an electric motor through a fixed reduction (no clutch or multi-speed gearbox to wear), so there''s no traditional gearbox fault pattern. It does have a petrol engine acting as a generator — so engine/hybrid-system health matters, even though the drive unit itself is simple.');
